    "name": "Sea Raiders : Stream Chat Games",
    "steam_appid": 2631810,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sea Raiders is an innovative pirate-themed massively collaborative game for streamer-viewer communities, played directly on Twitch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer-captain and viewer-crew go together on adventures, winning battles and solving puzzles in order to find treasures and develop their own unique island and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless instant play between streamers and all viewers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massively Collaborative Actions / Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross Stream Progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a streamer you are the captain of the island and lead adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewers are the crew, they influence the adventures and participate in all the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody has to collaborate in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How does it work ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stream the game on your channel, viewers use a custom made rich extension to participate in without having to install anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is currently in closed concept testing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are designing the game for and with streamers and their communities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord to learn more and participate in future tests and design discussions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sea Raiders is an innovative pirate-themed massively collaborative game for streamer-viewer communities, played directly on Twitch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer-captain and viewer-crew go together on adventures, winning battles and solving puzzles in order to find treasures and develop their own unique island and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless instant play between streamers and all viewers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massively Collaborative Actions / Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross Stream Progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a streamer you are the captain of the island and lead adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewers are the crew, they influence the adventures and participate in all the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody has to collaborate in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How does it work ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stream the game on your channel, viewers use a custom made rich extension to participate in without having to install anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is currently in closed concept testing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are designing the game for and with streamers and their communities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord to learn more and participate in future tests and design discussions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks</p>",
